exports[`dsh keyless credential journey snapshots > reports the missing credential once, stays usable, and survives resume 1`] = `
"› say hi

› say hi again

MISSING_CREDENTIAL: llm-deepseek: no API key for provider route "deepseek-official"; store
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY through the credentials service (in the terminal: /credential DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
<value>; in the web app: the Models page writes it), or export DEEPSEEK_API_KEY in the launching
environment

















